      "content": "Wait, I was looking at the nausea reports in the Phase III data. It's a bit higher than the generics, even if only slightly. And the speed of action is kind of borderline on the statistical significance. Won't that mess up our \"superior comfort\" angle? We don't want the regulators breathing down our necks for overstating the benefits.",
